++| Actual durable facts | Shared mutation policy and allowed actions |
++|---|---|
++| No publication and never published | Ordinary owner CAS/lifecycle gates; final-before-publish may be edited, clearing final on version advance. |
++| READY/RUNNING/RECONCILING, PREPARED/RETRY_QUEUED/MARKED/UNKNOWN or any unresolved prior operation | Freeze content, intent, reference mutation, current/retained generation effects; status/query only, no resend/supersede. |
