++Exact unchanged retry can keep old `retryAfterZeroEffect` and same fingerprint/r/e/request; it appends execution with full proof, updates existing publication READY under same root+atomic command transaction. A request with changed r/e/logical/destination/final takes replacement, not an undocumented relaxed retry. No-content valid-final location changes do not require a new final. Content changes use normal edits→new final before replacement. No second publication UUID.
