++All predecessor request/destination/payload/receipt/result rows remain immutable/queryable after current slot changes and restart. Unknown/NOT_OBSERVED cannot advance slot. Replacement accepted locally but network lost leaves new execution unresolved; lookup exact new execution may return UNKNOWN plus earlier failed receipt—earlier receipt cannot settle new execution. Provider permanent zero-effect rejection guarantees old request can never later produce a document; a contradictory late success is protocol violation, quarantine, never proof reuse. App/provider restart tests retain stores and enforce generation CAS.
