++Every observation/replay validates the exact token execution's ORIGINAL immutable manifest/logical digest, original full task spec and original publication_attempt→confirmation, not publication.current_confirmation or operation.current request_hash. Registered publication policy exposes separate private current-input validation and immutable historical receipt validation; latter grants NO business effect. For new PREPARED execution before attempt exists, its manifest/current publication are validated only in current strict branch.
