++For same-operation contradiction, preserve existing current_operation MANUAL_REQUIRED behavior and retain newer execution uncertainty; do not mark newer execution failed or settle its permit. For distinct older operation, fact records/quarantines that actual old operation and joined publication projection becomes manual locked; newer operation remains its real state. Historical lookup remains possible without current settings/destination permission, subject to fresh meeting ACL and original proof integrity. No current-root hash substitution, fake historical pair or old task full-spec overwrite.
