+PreparedPublicationReplacement is a private issuer-bound carrier, constructed only by registered publication assembler after S/A. It binds publication ID/current publication revision, actor/current r/e/current final/request/render/destination assertion, exact original operation/execution/task/attempt history and outside-authenticated immutable proof-set digest, selected same-key/new-key mode and new full TaskSpec/manifest. DTO/boolean/FAILED/interface implementation alone cannot mint it. Engine authenticates issuer+same DataSource+actual holder+registered KNOWLEDGE_PUBLISH_V1 policy+purpose and entire prelocked old/new domain/spec union. No generic acquisition-mode fence relaxation or public callback.
