+2026-10-23. **Prospective design for independent review.** This document selects executable contracts and future evidence gates. It does not adopt source, run tests, activate a provider or qualify Phase B. Only this file is written; no source/tests/DB/Docker/private environment/network/Git mutation/subagents.
