+# Phase B final confirmation/publication design adoption
+
+2026-10-23. Adopt the exact full-replacement Task11 R1 design under `artifacts/phase-b/b-remaining/task-11-design/`. R1 raw SHA256 `f18ae4734603709284d91345b2909eca9687627c825444fd8cfa06dd49d36ffc` (102,624 bytes / 405 lines); bounded independent R1 review `247c16e565986ebb61c8b60589240fd0fbd6bf82153826cb57bde72db42d3241` gives SPEC PASS / design APPROVED, both T11DR-01 and T11DR-02 ADDRESSED, zero new findings. Root previously read the complete actual delta, closure and final review. The unchanged original design/review, R1 closure, both actual review diffs, scoped brief, original prepared brief/extract, root zero-effect ruling, root delta and shared Task9/10 rank ruling are preserved as exact raw evidence with a manifest and nested `* -text` protection. R1 is the adopted design; original findings and historical review outcomes remain visible. This adopts design only, with no source implementation, test pass, runtime activation, provider or Phase B qualification.
+
+Final confirmation retains the existing final hashing algorithm and actual human-review semantics. It requires complete bounded current source/input/profile readiness, generation debt/PENDING disposition and outstanding accepted generation work even when no candidate exists, exact selected body/set/evidence/action graph and frozen actual human-review IDs. CONCLUSION/ACTION require WHOLE SUPPORTED with nonempty MEETING evidence; ACTION separately requires exact accepted nullable ACTION_FIELDS CONFIRMED. Prospective draft and stored final bytes must agree before the single business revision advance. BODY/OPEN_QUESTION do not acquire blanket human-support requirements.
+
+All mutators share an authoritative complete publication-history guard. Actual READY/RUNNING/RECONCILING, PREPARED/RETRY_QUEUED/MARKED/UNKNOWN, unresolved prior rounds and unapplied remote success freeze content/intent/reference/current and retained output. Verified remote/document success or ever-published permanently freezes content. A FAILED string alone never authorizes reopening: every accepted round must have admitted provider-zero-effect proof or a genuine sealed LOCAL_NEVER_MARKED decision, with no mapping/success/unknown/live work. Only then may fresh owner authority correct destination/configuration, edit and refinal when content changes, or explicitly resubmit. Keep one publication UUID and immutable accepted bindings, original task/execution/attempt/final/request facts. UNKNOWN, timeout, absent execution or marker-commit ambiguity never becomes inferred NOT_SENT.
+
+Marked publication retry/replacement remains a confined new publication-only authority with complete old/new inventory, genuine same issuer/DataSource/holder/current gates, exact historical manifests and old-token exclusion. Existing generic fixed-input `retryAfterZeroEffect` semantics are unchanged. A new-key operation obtains its real committed marker later; no invented MARKED timestamp or execution is created at acceptance. The controlled provider must serialize one durable document slot per publication with immutable execution history and authenticated proof-CAS across app/provider restarts. Mixed local-never-marked and remote-accepted histories must preserve actual provider predecessors without fabricated rejection receipts.
+
+`publication_submission` is an approved logical proposal only: no migration version is allocated, no SQL is generated, no bytes are frozen, no ACK is granted and nothing is applied. Its actual task-keyed immutable acceptance binding, bounded content-free manifest, real nullable execution link and one-way UNDECIDED to NEVER_MARKED local decision cannot be inferred from old hashes/current fields. Legacy absent binding is UNKNOWN/unavailable for this recovery/replacement. After actual Task8 schema, root must independently review exact column/collation/FK/index/CHECK definitions, overflow and immutable/one-way enforcement, then separately allocate/freeze the forward migration, obtain independent ACK, apply it and synchronize the current model. This design adoption does not pass any of those gates.
+
+Genuine local no-marker recovery covers no-execution, actual unmarked PREPARED and genuine locally terminated unmarked cases only, with complete prior-history proof, current owner/lifecycle authority, full ordered root/domain/task/attempt/operation/execution acquisition and real primary-DB resolution of marker commit uncertainty. A constructor-bound registered KNOWLEDGE_PUBLISH_V1 queue terminal hook must declare its full extra union before any task lock and consume genuine private phases once. Queue/attempt/external/submission/publication/events must commit or roll back atomically. Ordinary live-owner completion is distinct from forbidden abandonment of another live RUNNING owner; maintenance must not implicitly abandon eligible READY/live work. Explicit recovery/replay and bounded restart discovery remain source/evidence gates, preserving Task8's reserved fair sweep.
+
+Task7 owns genuine committed-marker send admission, external single-owner facts and postcommit settlement/permit recovery. Local publication failure is separate fresh-authority application, never an added domain writer in Task7's fact-only branch. There is no public callback, detached boolean/DTO authority, second root acquisition, late task discovery or restored old-token send permission. Actual Task5/7/8 facade composition, private queue-hook authority, both marker/recovery barrier orders and historical acknowledgment after later final/destination changes require independent source review and executable evidence.
+
+Every controlled KB route requires service bearer authentication plus Ed25519-signed actor/purpose/resource/request delegation, pinned client/store/key/TLS trust and protected restart-safe credential custody. The original actor comes from the genuine application session or immutable accepted requester; browser actor claims and destination assertions alone grant no authority. Revoked-actor receipt recovery stays narrowly fact-only. Official document viewing uses an authenticated same-origin bounded escaped-content relay with independent current application READ and provider DOCUMENT_READ, fresh local recheck after fetch, no-store/CSP and no credential-bearing redirect or arbitrary-URL fetch. Actual positive owner/member grants, missing/wrong-client/delegation/ACL negatives and usable document viewing remain HTTP/browser activation gates.
+
+The shared Task9/10 rank ruling and adopted Task3/6 internal order remain binding; existing submission rows occupy the R1-declared control rank after final headers and before mapping/publication-attempt headers, before all tasks/attempts/external rows. Candidate discovery grants no acquisition authority. One complete merged bounded union and effective read budget, protected metadata reservation before LONGTEXT transfer, outside-root archive/hash/parse/network work and fresh S/A/F equality remain mandatory. No old artifact or source bytes are replaced by this adoption.
+
+Before source activation reconcile actual adopted upstream facades, all-mutator call-site inventory, Task9 first-settings/render origin and Task10 saved/review/PENDING behavior. Draft/stored final goldens, rollback, marker/terminal/ACK races, retained-store fresh-process app/provider recovery, Task5 drain, Task8 fairness, producer repository-root OpenAPI and four-session native+S3 HTTPS browser chain remain prospective evidence gates. Company SSO/directory/model/KB, production publication/mail, HA/capacity/native-I/O and permanent B01 IMM PARTIAL/B04 Q401 UNKNOWN qualification are not supplied by this design record.
